# Companion/control case for kexhq/kex#343's fix
# (declared_function_shadows_ambiguous_import.kex): with no program-declared
# `parse` to shadow the pair, `Integer.parse` and `DateTime.parse` (both
# String -> Result<_, _>) are still reported ambiguous. The fix must only
# skip the ambiguity check when a declaration actually shadows it, never
# suppress the diagnostic outright.
main do
  IO.printLine(parse("x"))
end
